{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ؟ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܢܫܹܝܬ ܠܝܼ ܠܥܵܠܲܡ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܒܸܬ ܛܲܫܹܝܬ ܦܵܬܘܼܟ݂ ܡܸܢܝܼ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܡܲܬܒܸܢ ܪܸܢܝܵܐ ܒܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܲܫܵܐ ܒܠܸܒܝܼ ܟܠܹܗ ܝܵܘܡܵܐ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܪܵܐܹܡ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ ܥܲܠܝܼ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܘܼܪ ܓ̰ܲܘܸܒ ܠܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܲܗܪܸܢ ܥܲܝܢܝܼ̈ ܕܠܵܐ ܛܵܡܪܹܢ ܒܫܸܢܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܡܵܘܬܵ‌ܐ؛","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܠܵܐ ܐܵܡܹܪ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ: ”ܗܘܹܐ ܠܝܼ ܓ݂ܵܠܒܵܢܵܐ ܥܲܠܘܼܗ‌ܝ،“","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܡܲܠܝܸܨܵܢܝܼ̈ ܦܵܨܚܝܼ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܕܫܵܥܫܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܵܢܵܐ ܒܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂ ܣܒܝܼܪܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܦܵܨܹܚ ܠܸܒܝܼ ܒܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܙܵܡܪܹܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܒܦܸܪܝܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܩܵܡ ܦܵܪܹܥ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}